      `the certificate was executed in accordance with § 103` IS A BOOLEAN -- out of range: section 103 (piece dg1)
      `the certificate was executed by an authorized person of the surviving or resulting limited liability company` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 264(c) the certificate is executed as the subsection requires` MEANS
    IF `dg8 the combination ends in a corporation of this State` form
    THEN `the certificate was executed in accordance with § 103`
    ELSE `the certificate was executed by an authorized person of the surviving or resulting limited liability company`

-- A certificate of merger or consolidation may be filed in lieu of the agreement when it is executed as required and states what is required.
-- src:1313 | In lieu of filing the agreement of merger or consolidation, the surviving or resulting corporation or limited liability company may file a certificate of merger or consolidation, executed in accordance with § 103 of this title, if the surviving or resulting entity is a corporation, or by an authorized person, if the surviving or resulting entity is a limited liability company, which states:
@ref 8 Del. C. § 264(c) (src:1313)
GIVEN executed IS A BOOLEAN
      stated IS A BOOLEAN
