    `s 264(d) the limited liability company irrevocably appoints the Secretary of State as its agent to accept service of process in any such suit or other proceedings`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `s 264(d) the limited liability company specifies the address to which a copy of such process shall be mailed by the Secretary of State`  IS A BOOLEAN

@ref 8 Del. C. § 264(d) (src:1322)
